    "excluded": "COST_MODEL_SENSITIVE pairs (verdict flips inside the cost band)",
    "features": "per name: mom_21/63/252, mom_12_1, vol_21/63, drawdown_252 \u2014 taken for A, for B, and as B-A. Nothing forward, and explicitly NOT cs_rank/cs_decile, which are ranks OF the forward return (measured IC +1.0000 / +0.9950 against it).",
